391
00:19:45,880 --> 00:19:46,840
the Canadian CD.

392
00:19:46,840 --> 00:19:49,520
But now there's on chain stablecoins where you can go directly.

393
00:19:49,520 --> 00:19:53,680
Mentor protocol is in protocol in the ecosystem, which is doing a lot of FX.

394
00:19:53,680 --> 00:19:55,800
They were on the podcast last week.

395
00:19:55,800 --> 00:19:57,480
That's perfect. I love that team.

396
00:19:57,480 --> 00:19:58,480
They're a really great team.

397
00:19:58,480 --> 00:20:01,360
And I'm sure they talked about how you can go from one currency to the other

