00:20:19,880 --> 00:20:21,240
And I don't think that's happened yet.

407
00:20:21,240 --> 00:20:22,880
And I think they're coming slowly, slowly.

408
00:20:22,880 --> 00:20:24,520
They're looking at all of this slowly.

409
00:20:24,520 --> 00:20:26,720
Yeah, I agree. I think it'll be lucrative.

