but I don't know when that world will be,

728
00:32:12,160 --> 00:32:13,480
but it's interesting.

729
00:32:13,480 --> 00:32:14,920
We were talking about collective intelligence.

730
00:32:14,920 --> 00:32:17,120
I think one of the reasons we specifically

731
00:32:17,120 --> 00:32:18,840
have been successful as an ecosystem

732
00:32:18,840 --> 00:32:21,000
is because we have regional DAOs also.

733
00:32:21,000 --> 00:32:22,560
So we have a DAO in Africa.

734
00:32:22,560 --> 00:32:24,200
We have a LATAM DAO.

735
00:32:24,200 --> 00:32:25,640
We have a Thailand DAO.

736
00:32:25,640 --> 00:32:26,840
We have a Philippines DAO.

737
00:32:26,840 --> 00:32:29,960
And because we think that every region should have a say

738
00:32:29,960 --> 00:32:33,000
in how we represent in that region.

739
00:32:33,040 --> 00:32:35,000
These DAO communities have been incredible

740
00:32:35,000 --> 00:32:37,440
and also very active in our governance process.

741
00:32:37,440 --> 00:32:40,320
And so as we're thinking about how do we do

742
00:32:40,320 --> 00:32:42,560
a go-to-market strategy for that specific DAO,

743
00:32:42,560 --> 00:32:44,760
it's been really helpful to have the communities in there

744
00:32:44,760 --> 00:32:47,520
have a massive say in some of those decision-making.

745
00:32:47,520 --> 00:32:50,000
I'm big-proponent again of decentralized governance.

746
00:32:50,000 --> 00:32:51,640
I know it has some flaws.

747
00:32:51,640 --> 00:32:53,880
We've all experienced some flaws at decentralized governance,

748
00:32:53,880 --> 00:32:56,080
but I think overall, if you're able to manage it,

749
00:32:56,080 --> 00:32:57,320
I think incredible concept.

750
00:32:57,320 --> 00:33:00,440
I'm excited to see where it evolves in the next five years.

751
00:33:00,440 --> 00:33:03,120
I guess if you're going to have a digital financial system

752
00:33:03,120 --> 00:33:05,280
or monetary system, you should have some form

753
00:33:05,280 --> 00:33:08,440
of democratic monetary decision-making.

754
00:33:08,440 --> 00:33:11,400
100% we're 100% aligned on that.

